po}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T17:20:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T17:20:59Z","body":"> I don't know if it's intended or not but if you put a shader on for example Sprite2D you won't see the TEXTURE built-in variable.\r\n\r\nThis is a limitation of previews since it's basically a `ColorRect` without a texture property and changing it to either `Sprite2D` or `TextureRect` is too dangerous and clumpy for this PR.\r\n\r\n> Not too fond of the buttons under each preview taking up a big chunk of useful space.\r\n\r\nYes, this is definitely could be improved in a future, I just don't have an idea of how to make it less space consuming right now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4193808938/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209168981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726#issuecomment-4209168981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117726","id":4209168981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc764tJV","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_use